### 2. Backend — Node.js + Express + MongoDB

#### [NEW] [package.json](file:///d:/CAPSTRONE/server/package.json)
Dependencies: `express`, `mongoose`, `bcryptjs`, `jsonwebtoken`, `multer`, `cors`, `dotenv`, `pdfkit`, `morgan`

#### [NEW] [db.js](file:///d:/CAPSTRONE/server/config/db.js)
MongoDB connection using Mongoose with connection string from `.env`

#### [NEW] [server.js](file:///d:/CAPSTRONE/server/server.js)
Express app setup with CORS, JSON parsing, route mounting, and server start

#### Database Models

| Model | Key Fields |
|-------|-----------|
| **User** | `name`, `email`, `password` (hashed), `role` (admin/officer/analyst/supervisor) |
| **Case** | `caseId` (unique), `title`, `description`, `status` (open/in-progress/closed), `createdBy`, `assignedInvestigators[]` |
| **Evidence** | `caseId` (ref), `fileName`, `filePath`, `fileSize`, `hashValue` (SHA-256), `uploadedBy`, `description`, `category` |
| **CustodyLog** | `evidenceId` (ref), `action`, `performedBy`, `timestamp`, `details` |
| **Task** | `evidenceId` (ref), `assignedBy`, `assignedTo`, `status` (pending/accepted/rejected/completed), `rejectionReason` |
| **Finding** | `evidenceId` (ref), `content` (text notes), `addedBy`, `timestamp` |

#### API Endpoints

| Method | Route | Description | Auth |
|--------|-------|-------------|------|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | Register user | Public |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Login, returns JWT | Public |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | Get current user | ✅ |
| GET/POST | `/api/cases` | List / Create cases | ✅ Officer+ |
| GET/PUT/DELETE | `/api/cases/:id` | Case CRUD | ✅ |
| GET/POST | `/api/evidence/:caseId` | List / Upload evidence | ✅ |
| GET | `/api/evidence/detail/:id` | Evidence detail | ✅ |
| POST | `/api/evidence/:id/verify` | Re-hash and verify integrity | ✅ |
| GET | `/api/custody/:evidenceId` | Get custody log | ✅ |
| GET/POST | `/api/tasks` | List / Create task assignments | ✅ Supervisor |
| PUT | `/api/tasks/:id/respond` | Accept/reject task | ✅ Analyst |
| GET/POST | `/api/findings/:evidenceId` | Get / Add findings | ✅ |
| POST | `/api/ai/summarize/:evidenceId` | Summarize findings (mock AI) | ✅ |
| GET | `/api/reports/:caseId` | Generate PDF report | ✅ |

#### [NEW] [hashUtils.js](file:///d:/CAPSTRONE/server/utils/hashUtils.js)
- `generateHash(filePath)` — SHA-256 hash of uploaded file using Node.js `crypto`
- Used on upload and for re-verification

#### [NEW] [pdfGenerator.js](file:///d:/CAPSTRONE/server/utils/pdfGenerator.js)
- Uses PDFKit to generate a structured forensic report containing:
  - Case details, evidence list, hash verification, custody log, findings, AI summary

